      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Sunspear is a brown fort playground with Cherry Red tube slides and rope net climbers. A climbing wall rises on one face, nets lead up the others, and the red tube slides wind back down. It suits children who want a harder climb, and it gives older groups a fort to defend. Sunspear takes 20 to 25 children. Its product area is 34'1\" x 28'3\". The skills it builds include team building, leadership and seeing a game from another child's side. Parks, resorts and schools with a dedicated older-children zone are a good match. Its galvanised pipe, roto-moulded slides, laminates and nets are under a 3-year warranty. Tell us your site size for a layout drawing."
